=== ip ===
USAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  ip [ OPTIONS ] OBJECT { COMMAND | help }
  ip [ -force ] -batch filename


POSITIONALS (2) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  OBJECT
  COMMAND


FLAGS (21) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Options
    -V[ersion]
    -s[tatistics]
    -d[etails]
    -r[esolve]
    -h[uman-readable] | -iec | -j[son] | -p[retty] |
    -f[amily]         { inet | inet6 | mpls | bridge | link } |
-4
-6
-M
-B
-0
    -l[oops]          { maximum-addr-flush-attempts } | -br[ief] |
    -o[neline]
    -t[imestamp]
    -ts[hort]
    -b[atch] [filename]
    -rc[vbuf] [size]
    -n[etns] name
    -N[umeric]
    -a[ll]
    -c[olor]
